    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_14",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Nanjing is one of the most beautiful cities of mainland China with lush green parks, natural scenic lakes, small mountains, historical buildings and monuments, relics and much more, which attracts thousands of tourists every year.",
